## 获取发布任务详情

| method | GET |
|-|-|
| url | /v1.0/work/tasks/{taskId}/detail |
| buc login | true |

### Path parameters

| 参数名称 | 参数类型 | 必传 | 默认值 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|-|-|-|
| taskId | Number | true | - | 发布任务 ID |

### Returns

| 参数名称 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|
| task | 发布任务详情，结构为: { ...[Task](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8dfb66h0t67j0phai), user: [User](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls369lxfelxab4mn50j), devbranches: [Change](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8c5351a5qllc8tzaq)[] } |
| flownodes | 发布流水线节点信息 |
| flow | 发布流水线模板 |
| info | 流水线及容器 ID |
| status | 发布流水线状态 |
| runtime | 发布流水线运行时信息 |

